{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0m50zkp_cc0ea.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3byuobrkyz9bj.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1gyk2jivcdvi5.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2m4m9nb5n9c8m.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/01xvme0g7e_u8.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1ul2yjcbbl05m.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3yipl-s8rbscu.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#059669\"/><title>Mindfit — Emagrecimento Saudável em 21 Dias</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Plataforma de emagrecimento saudável com plano alimentar personalizado, receitas, treinos guiados e acompanhamento de progresso em ciclos de 21 dias.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Mindfit\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"emagrecimento saudável,perder peso,dieta 21 dias,plano alimentar,treino em casa,reeducação alimentar,método 21 dias\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Mindfit — Transforme seus hábitos. Transforme seu corpo.\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Plataforma de emagrecimento saudável com plano alimentar personalizado, receitas, treinos guiados e acompanhamento de progresso em ciclos de 21 dias.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Mindfit\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"pt_BR\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Mindfit — Transforme seus hábitos. Transforme seu corpo.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Plataforma de emagrecimento saudável com plano alimentar personalizado, receitas, treinos guiados e acompanhamento de progresso em ciclos de 21 dias.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-800 selection:bg-primary-500 selection:text-white\"><div class=\"bg-primary-700 text-white text-center py-2 px-4 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span>⚡ Oferta de Lançamento:</span><span class=\"text-amber-300 font-extrabold\">Apenas R$ 49,90</span><span>— Pagamento Único Vitalício</span></div><header class=\"px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between relative z-20\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-extrabold text-xl font-[var(--font-heading)]\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">🍃</span><span>Mindfit</span></a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-4 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/login\">Entrar</a><a class=\"px-4 sm:px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold bg-accent-500 hover:bg-accent-400 text-neutral-900 transition-all shadow-md hover:scale-105\" href=\"/checkout\">Começar Agora</a></div></header><section class=\"relative pt-12 pb-20 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-32 px-4 sm:px-6 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10 space-y-8\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-primary-200 shadow-sm animate-fade-in\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping\"></span><span>Método Comprovado de 21 Dias • Pagamento Único de R$ 49,90</span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black font-[var(--font-heading)] text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1]\">Transforme seu corpo e hábitos em<!-- --> <span class=\"text-gradient underline decoration-primary-400 decoration-wavy decoration-2\">21 dias</span>.</h1><p class=\"text-base sm:text-xl text-primary-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Sem dietas malucas, sem passar fome e sem horas na academia. Um plano alimentar realista com receitas brasileiras, treinos rápidos guiados e gamificação diária.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4\"><a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/checkout\"><button class=\"\n          inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium\n          transition-all duration-200 ease-out\n          focus-ring\n          disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:transform-none\n          bg-gradient-accent text-neutral-900 font-semibold hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg\n          px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-2xl gap-3\n          w-full\n          shadow-elevated hover:scale-105 transition-all text-neutral-900 font-extrabold px-8 py-5 text-lg\n        \">Garantir Meu Acesso Vitalício por R$ 49,90 →</button></a><a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"\n          inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium\n          transition-all duration-200 ease-out\n          focus-ring\n          disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:transform-none\n          border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-50 active:bg-primary-100\n          px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-2xl gap-3\n          w-full\n          text-white border-white/30 hover:bg-white/10 py-5\n        \">Já sou aluno (Entrar)</button></a></div><div class=\"pt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-primary-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-amber-300\">⭐</span> 4.9/5 estrelas de satisfação</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-300\">🛡️</span> Garantia de 7 dias ou seu dinheiro de volta</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-blue-300\">📱</span> Funciona direto no seu celular (PWA)</span></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-16\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-primary-600 bg-primary-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary-100\">A Metodologia</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-[var(--font-heading)] text-neutral-900\">Como funciona o Método 21 Dias?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-500\">Dividimos a transformação em 3 ciclos estratégicos para seu corpo e sua mente se adaptarem sem sofrimento.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        border-2 border-neutral-100\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><span class=\"text-3xl\">🌱</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-primary-700 bg-primary-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Dias 1 a 7</span></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2\">Fase 1: Preparação &amp; Limpeza</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Desinflamação metabólica, ajuste natural do paladar, eliminação de retenção hídrica e ativação de rotinas diárias com leveza.</p></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        border-2 border-neutral-100\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><span class=\"text-3xl\">🔥</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-primary-700 bg-primary-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Dias 8 a 14</span></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2\">Fase 2: Queima Ativa &amp; Porções</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Controle de porções através do semáforo volumétrico, treinos guiados intervalados para queima acelerada e aumento da energia.</p></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        border-2 border-neutral-100\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><span class=\"text-3xl\">🏆</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-primary-700 bg-primary-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">Dias 15 a 21</span></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2\">Fase 3: Consistência &amp; Manutenção</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Consolidação dos novos hábitos neurológicos, autonomia alimentar e prevenção definitiva do efeito sanfona.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 pt-10 border-t border-neutral-100\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-3xl block\">🥗</span><h4 class=\"font-bold text-neutral-900 text-base\">Cardápios Brasileiros Reais</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Arroz, feijão, frango, frutas da época e receitas práticas de até 20 minutos. Nada de ingredientes caros ou inacessíveis.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-3xl block\">🚦</span><h4 class=\"font-bold text-neutral-900 text-base\">Semáforo de Volumetria</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Aprenda a comer mais volume com menos calorias, sem precisar passar fome ou viver de folhas secas.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-3xl block\">⏱️</span><h4 class=\"font-bold text-neutral-900 text-base\">Treinos Guiados em Casa</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Exercícios curtos de 12 a 20 minutos com cronômetro sonoro e demonstrações visuais para qualquer nível.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-3xl block\">🧊</span><h4 class=\"font-bold text-neutral-900 text-base\">Gamificação Sem Culpa</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed\">Streaks com &quot;Freeze Gentil&quot; que perdoam dias de descanso. Aqui você constrói constância com acolhimento.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-neutral-50\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-12\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-3 max-w-xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-primary-600 bg-primary-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary-100\">Histórias Reais</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-[var(--font-heading)] text-neutral-900\">Quem experimentou, transformou.</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">Pessoas reais que encontraram equilíbrio e resultados duradouros no Método 21 Dias.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        bg-white space-y-4\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Juliana Mendes\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-primary-500\"/><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900\">Juliana Mendes</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">34<!-- --> anos • <!-- -->São Paulo, SP</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200\">-4.8 kg em 21 dias</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 italic leading-relaxed\">&quot;<!-- -->Eu vivia no efeito sanfona porque não conseguia cortar arroz e feijão. O Mindfit me ensinou o semáforo volumétrico e eu emagreci comendo comida de verdade com a minha família!<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class=\"text-amber-400 text-sm\">★★★★★</div></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        bg-white space-y-4\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Rodrigo Silveira\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-primary-500\"/><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900\">Rodrigo Silveira</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">41<!-- --> anos • <!-- -->Belo Horizonte, MG</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200\">-6.2 kg em 21 dias</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 italic leading-relaxed\">&quot;<!-- -->Rotina corrida de trabalho e filhos. Os treinos de 15 minutos e a lista de compras automática salvaram meu tempo e me deram uma disposição que eu não sentia há 10 anos.<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class=\"text-amber-400 text-sm\">★★★★★</div></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        p-7\n        hover:shadow-elevated hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\n        bg-white space-y-4\n      \"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Camila Ferreira\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-primary-500\"/><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900\">Camila Ferreira</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400\">28<!-- --> anos • <!-- -->Curitiba, PR</p></div></div><div class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200\">-3.9 kg em 21 dias</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 italic leading-relaxed\">&quot;<!-- -->O que mais amei foi a mecânica de streak sem culpa. Nos dias difíceis usei o freeze e não desisti. A plataforma é linda, fácil e super motivadora!<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class=\"text-amber-400 text-sm\">★★★★★</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-hero text-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-12 relative z-10\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><span class=\"\n        inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium rounded-full\n        bg-gradient-accent text-neutral-900\n        px-2.5 py-1 text-sm\n        \n      \">Condição Especial de Lançamento</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-[var(--font-heading)]\">Acesso Completo &amp; Vitalício</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-primary-200 max-w-xl mx-auto\">Sem pegadinhas, sem assinaturas mensais. Pague uma única vez e tenha a plataforma para sempre.</p></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        glass\n        p-7\n        \n        max-w-xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6 border-white/20\n      \"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest line-through\">De R$ 197,00</span><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1\"><span class=\"text-lg text-primary-200\">Por apenas</span><span class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-amber-300 font-[var(--font-heading)]\">R$ <!-- -->49,90</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-300\">Pagamento único no Pix ou Cartão • Acesso imediato</p></div><ul class=\"text-left space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-200 max-w-md mx-auto\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Plano Alimentar Completo de 21 Dias (3 Fases)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Banco de Alimentos Brasileiros com Semáforo</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Catálogo com Dezenas de Receitas Práticas</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Lista de Compras Automática para o Mercado</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Vídeos e Cronômetro de Treinos em Casa</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Diário Alimentar e Registro de Água Diário</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Gamificação com Streaks &amp; Quadro de Medalhas</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">✓</span><span>Garantia Incondicional de 7 Dias</span></li></ul><a class=\"block\" href=\"/checkout\"><button class=\"\n          inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium\n          transition-all duration-200 ease-out\n          focus-ring\n          disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:transform-none\n          bg-gradient-accent text-neutral-900 font-semibold hover:opacity-90 active:opacity-80 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg\n          px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-2xl gap-3\n          w-full\n          font-extrabold text-neutral-900 shadow-elevated text-lg py-5\n        \">Quero Minha Vaga no Método 21 Dias →</button></a><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-neutral-400\"><span>🛡️</span><span>Risco Zero: 7 dias de garantia ou 100% do dinheiro de volta</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-3\"><span class=\"text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-primary-600 bg-primary-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary-100\">Dúvidas Comuns</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-[var(--font-heading)] text-neutral-900\">Perguntas Frequentes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">Tudo o que você precisa saber antes de começar sua transformação de 21 dias.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        \n        \n        overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 transition-all\n      \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors\"><span>O pagamento é mensal ou único?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 font-normal\">−</span></button><div class=\"p-5 pt-0 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/50 animate-fade-in\">O pagamento é 100% ÚNICO! Você paga apenas R$ 49,90 uma vez e tem acesso vitalício a toda a plataforma, sem nenhuma mensalidade ou cobrança recorrente.</div></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        \n        \n        overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 transition-all\n      \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors\"><span>Preciso de academia ou equipamentos para fazer os treinos?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 font-normal\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        \n        \n        overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 transition-all\n      \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors\"><span>Os alimentos do plano são difíceis de encontrar ou caros?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 font-normal\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n        bg-white border border-neutral-200 shadow-card\n        \n        \n        overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 transition-all\n      \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-5 text-left font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-neutral-50 transition-colors\"><span>Quanto tempo por dia preciso dedicar?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 font-normal\">+</span></button></div><div class=\"\n        rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300\n